# Installed by billet's host role on a host it gives Ceph. needrestart must never
# restart a Ceph daemon here: this host's kernel maps billet's volumes from the
# same OSDs, and an OSD's start runs `ceph-volume`, whose `lvs` reads every block
# device, the mapped volumes too, whose writeback waits on the OSDs being started.
# On 2026-11-13 a libc6 upgrade restarted both OSDs of the reference deployment
# that way, neither came back, and its fleet ran nothing for nine hours. Ceph's
# daemons are restarted by an operator, with no billet volume mapped or with the
# OSDs' activation in hand.
$nrconf{override_rc}{qr(^ceph-)} = 0;
